WEBVTT

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:47.370
On the section thaft asks what your hobbies are on a résumé,

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.560
Yes?

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:51.670
you write down reading even if it
really means reading manga, right?

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.590
Oh, that's typical.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.460
It's like how watching movies
really means watching anime,

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:58.340
and being computer literate
means you play a lot of games.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:01.350
Listening to music only applies to anime and games, too.

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:06.810
Am I allowed to write down
loli or forehead?

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.790
If you want to, sure.

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:10.270
Tsundere, too.

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:14.230
You sound like you've never written that word before.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:17.320
Idiot. It isn't the first time.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.980
I was just using it as an example.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.390
You must be tired.

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:25.580
Yeah, I feel half-dead.

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.370
It must be tough.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:32.290
Who said the economy was on the
rise and that it was a seller's market?

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:38.510
That aside, I admire you for having the courage to start looking for a job at this period of your senior year, Madarame-san.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:43.100
Yeah. Some of the impatient
third-year students are already looking.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.360
You're kidding.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:47.270
They'll only end up like this, though.

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:52.460
I'm getting sick of seeing so many faces.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.440
I don't even want to go out.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:59.660
This suit makes me feel really uptight. I can't take it anymore.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.570
Are suits expensive?

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:04.390
No, this was a cheap one I bought off the rack.

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:08.000
The measurements aren't perfect, but it's good enough.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.710
Tanaka made this necktie for me.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:11.960
It's hand-made.

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:13.880
You must be joking.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.750
I'm serious. Take a look,
it's something else!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.170
Wow, amazing!

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.720
<i>Just kidding!</i>

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.830
Can I pull on it?

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:24.510
Pull on it 'til I die.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.560
Hey, Ogiue-san. How's it going?

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:38.570
Hey.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.990
Hello.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.740
Don't make me look like an idiot.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.920
Um, Sasahara-senpai,

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.250
can I ask you something?

00:03:55.540 --> 00:04:00.300
Can I see the schedule for the
Comifes deadline if you still have it?

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:01.710
Schedule for the Comifes deadline?

00:04:01.710 --> 00:04:03.760
If you don't, a production note is fine.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.230
I might have the schedule at my
house if I haven't thrown it away yet.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:09.250
I see.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.680
I'll be on my way.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.810
I need to get going myself.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:15.560
I'll bring the schedule with me tomorrow.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:16.540
Thanks.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:17.600
Bye.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:18.500
See you later.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:31.040
<i>Those two seem to get along rather well for some reason,</i>

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:39.050
<i>although they were acting suspicious earlier.</i>

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:42.470
<i>"Don't make me look like an idiot"?</i>

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:45.830
<i>How'd they end up pulling ties?</i>

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:50.210
<i>Who knows? Even if it doesn't imply anything,</i>

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:53.600
<i>they must be pretty intimate to play around like that.</i>

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.860
<i>Idiot!
Why are you getting caught up with these kinds of thoughts?</i>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.020
<i>What's gotten into me?</i>

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:08.410
<i>There's no doubt about one thing.
Madarame-senpai's definitely at the receiving end.</i>

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:18.940
What's with this necktie?

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:22.050
Were you thinking about graduating and leaving me behind?

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.760
It's not what you think. This is...

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:31.390
Did you think you could run away... No, rather, forget about me?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:43.700
<i>Wow, that was close.</i>

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:53.000
<i>I had just enrolled in the university at that time.</i>

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.200
<i>I was in a state of both anticipation and anxiety.</i>

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.670
A new member?

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:19.520
Yes.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.190
Please come in.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:24.650
My name is Madarame.
I'm the president of this club.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:32.280
I'm S-Sasahara Kanji.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.700
<i>I was struck by lightning,</i>

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:37.250
<i>a lightning called love.</i>

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:47.770
Sasahara?

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:49.050
Were you shopping?

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.050
Yeah, I was checking out some recent titles.

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.430
That Menma title is pretty good.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:58.350
Is that so, Sasahara?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.210
Yes.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.420
You should come to my place.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.040
There's something I want to show you.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.860
<i>I told a lie.</i>

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:21.040
Wow, this is pretty rare.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.710
You can have it.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:23.920
Really?

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:29.090
She'd be happy to be taken in by someone who likes her.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.200
Someone who likes...

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:39.680
Senpai, are you the type of person who
wants to be owned by the man you love?

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:51.300
You know how I feel, don't you?

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:53.390
I refuse to accept otherwise.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.210
Sasa...

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:05.250
<i>Something like that. Wonderful! Wonderful!</i>

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.370
<i>Madarame-san would fall head over heels for him, too.</i>

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.300
Nyoron!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.980
A-All alone?

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:17.200
Sasahara-san and Madarame-san were here just a little while ago.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:22.920
I-Is it o-okay for him to be here instead of l-looking for a job?

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.310
He was wearing a suit.

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:28.130
O-Oh, a-at least he's doing something,

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.820
b-but that goes without saying.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.250
Moratorium banzai! NEET banzai!

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:37.320
I faithfully believe in living life by sleeping throughout the day.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.580
I-I'd like to do that if I could.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:43.810
I-I bet all otakus feel the same way.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:48.560
T-There's no way they'd spend t-time and money on
anything else besides their hobbies if they had a choice.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:50.500
Kugayama-san, have you found a job?

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:54.610
I-I was h-hired during the summer.

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.410
Congratulations.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.860
I-I couldn't bring myself to say it for one reason or another.

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:02.680
I-I'm glad M-Madarame is taking it seriously.

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:06.850
This place is a haven for human scum.

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:20.410
<i>A cool type and a natural type?</i>

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:23.740
<i>That's a bit of a stretch,
but there's no harm in it, right?</i>

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.870
<i>Harems are normal, after all.</i>

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:28.880
It hurts!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.210
Sorry.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:37.610
Did it hurt that much? You might have strained it.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.590
Are you okay?

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:50.350
This is the first time I've...
I've been treated so kindly.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:06.200
You came after all. Is champagne all right?

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:09.370
Kugayama-san, the reason I came here was...

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:13.540
Sit down. This isn't a request, it's an order.

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.580
<i>That's out of the question.</i>

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:27.800
<i>Madarame-san definitely has to be with Sasahara-san!</i>

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.810
<i>Sasa x Mada, Sasa x Mada...</i>

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:37.400
<i>Sasahara-san's a young tyrant, while Madarame-san's a sensitive, tormented character.</i>

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:41.480
<i>Sasahara-san needs to be aggressive with him.</i>

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.910
I didn't think you'd come.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.080
Why wouldn't I?

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:52.540
I thought you didn't like me,
Madarame-san.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:56.920
I did force you to do that, after all.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:03.820
You accepted me at that time, didn't you, Madarame-san?

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:06.770
Not only did you accept me,
you earnestly...

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.440
Sasahara...

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:14.940
You earnestly enjoyed it.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.320
Am I wrong?

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:19.780
That was...

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:26.710
The reason you came here wasn't
because you were afraid of hurting my feelings.

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:27.620
On the contrary,

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.770
What?

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:31.790
you wanted me to tear you apart, didn't you?

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:33.920
Let go...

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:37.340
Do you really want me to let you go?

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:41.900
Let go!

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:59.330
<i>Tanaka-san's personality sure changed a lot.</i>

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.410
<i>Is it because he's going out with Ohno-san?</i>

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:04.950
<i>Are all guys like that?</i>

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.450
<i>It wouldn't be a stretch for him
to have some kind of ulterior motive.</i>

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:15.840
<i>The reason behind it would be Madarame-san,
which then causes Sasahara-san to become traumatized.</i>

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.620
Why?

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:27.390
Hey.

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:32.140
Tanaka-san, Ohno-san is your fiancé, isn't she?

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:35.060
What difference does that make?

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:38.030
I was using that woman as camouflage.

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:43.120
She never made an effort to realize who I loved the most.

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:48.040
That can't be...

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.120
Sasa, wait!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.210
I won't let you go.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.090
Don't leave.

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:04.250
If you leave me, how will I ever go on?

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:06.260
I won't be able to live.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:20.440
<i>I've gone too far.</i>

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.310
<i>Well, why not?</i>

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:25.920
<i>This is great!</i>

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:29.830
<i>Next on the list is Madarame-san,
the fall guy.</i>

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:41.080
Um, this isn't...

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:42.080
Really...

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.380
What is it?

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:48.280
I didn't see anything.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.850
I just came in right now.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:52.660
Is Kousaka coming today?

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.150
Howdy!

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:59.860
Hey Kucchii, you're not welcome!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:02.570
No! That's mean! That's mean!

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:10.690
The last part is pretty disorganized, but are you...

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:13.630
Ogiue-san, are you going to participate in the Comifes?

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.330
Am I wrong?

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.670
No, I haven't thought about anything like that yet.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:18.780
I haven't thought about it at all.

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:23.520
I see. You helped us out a lot last time, Ogiue-san,

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:26.050
so if there's anything we can do, feel free to ask.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.050
T-Thank you very much.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.180
Oh.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.430
Hi!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:34.830
Sorry, Kousaka. Can we go back?

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:36.520
What's wrong?

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.350
I just remembered I needed to do something.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.100
Did you forget something?

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:44.750
Yeah, I forgot something important. Can you come with me?

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:45.840
Sure.

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:49.660
<i>This is a misunderstanding.
This is definitely a misunderstanding.</i>

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.310
See you two later!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:53.000
Good luck.

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:55.580
Okay...

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:57.600
Excuse me.

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:01.000
This is a huge misunderstanding.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.580
It isn't what you think it is.

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:04.680
What are you talking about?

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:09.350
I mean... I didn't draw it with that intention.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:11.590
Why did you draw it?

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:17.060
<i>I can't bring myself to say it's a boys' love story...</i>

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:19.620
Oh, sorry, Kousaka.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:20.450
It's okay.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:26.130
Drawing pictures of the person you like is
expected of someone who can draw, right?

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:28.650
That may be true,

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.280
but this is completely different!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:33.450
Now, now. Leave it to me.

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:36.710
I had a feeling something was going on between you two.

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.920
No, I'm trying to say that isn't true.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:43.530
Oh, sorry, Kousaka. Let's just return to the room.

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:44.250
Sure.

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:50.240
Are you going to be a vendor again, Sasahara?

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.680
I wouldn't mind doing it.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:57.650
Well, I haven't even thought about participating yet,

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.640
so even if you ask me about vending...

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.530
Doesn't that mean you've been thinking about it?

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:04.300
Why don't you just do it?

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:06.360
You're going to help out, right, Sasahara?

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:10.270
If Ogiue-san doesn't have another person in mind.

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:12.880
No, that's okay. I'll do it myself.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.370
I mean... if I even do it in the first place.

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:19.620
You can't even go to the bathroom if you do it alone.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.210
I'll find a way to manage.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.500
I don't think Ohno will help you out,

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:26.220
and there's no way Kasukabe-san would do it, either.

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:27.170
Of course.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:34.140
If Sasahara helps you with the vending,
people might look at you with a fit of jealousy.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.620
There's no way that'd happen.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:42.030
Isn't the probability of a female otaku having a boyfriend extremely low?

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:43.320
What about Ohno-san?

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.250
She's an exception.

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:49.790
The odds of finding such a perfect partner are
really low, even for someone who isn't an otaku.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:52.910
Well, yeah, you might be right.

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:54.860
They were made for each other.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:58.750
In other words, they're two of a kind.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:03.900
There aren't many guys who hang out
around the female doujinshi section, right?

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:06.510
Well, it's not like I've been there that often.

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:10.730
You have no choice but to ask someone to help you out.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.440
Right, Ogiue?

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.390
I'm leaving.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.600
Kousaka-san...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:28.120
I can't afford to waste my time being your security blanket.

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.180
Are you finished?

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:31.860
Yeah.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:55.720
Wasn't he your favorite, Kousaka?

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:58.740
It's over. I've become bored with him.

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:02.170
I see. You'll be able to make it to the conference after all.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:07.970
Farewell. I loved you while you
were still a man who took pride in himself.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.960
Madarame... san?

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:45.600
I'm glad.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.780
Why?

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.770
As long as you're with me, it'll be okay.

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:52.070
I'm tainted. I've become tainted.

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:53.900
Who cares?

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:58.820
I don't care about how tainted you've become. Everything will be fine as long as I have you.

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:11.380
Madarame-san, you can't do that!

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:14.300
Don't move. Tonight, I'll...

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:18.900
This is the first time I've ever felt this way.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:21.720
Madarame-san, I can't hold myself back anymore.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:22.860
Go ahead.

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:34.620
<i>I may have been the one who was being restrained,</i>

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:35.610
<i>however...</i>

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.230
I can't allow you to restrain me.

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:44.490
I'm the one who must dominate you.

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:53.590
I'll be the one who'll make you feel

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:57.420
anguish, sorrow, regret, and ecstasy.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.420
Everything.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:19:59.820
Yes.

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:06.140
I want everything... everything you have, Sasahara.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.440
Is it okay?

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.350
Yes.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:26.560
Why'd you call me out here?

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:29.330
Um, I wanted to talk.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.250
About Sasahara?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.240
It'll be all right!

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.780
I'll set you two up in a subtle manner.

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:38.160
I'm saying that there's been a misunderstanding.

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:39.510
Take a look at this.

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:40.440
What is it?

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.420
This.

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:50.980
Oh, so that's what it was.

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:53.090
Do you understand now?

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:55.940
Oh, I get it, I get it. Sorry.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:56.740
It's okay.

00:20:58.040 --> 00:20:59.900
You're having a hard time, aren't you?

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.280
Well, it's not that, but...

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:07.070
I can't blame you for feeling that way.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:07.950
Wh-What?

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.420
A love triangle, huh?

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:15.410
<i>She's hopeless.</i>

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:52.830
<i>I'm going to show this to
Ohno-senpai just to see how she reacts.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:57.080
Sasahara-san's the one who's
aggressively humping, isn't he?

00:22:57.640 --> 00:22:59.830
<i>She understood the situation in 1.5 seconds.</i>

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:05.540
In my opinion, Madarame-san's weak humping fits better.

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:09.630
<i>She has no taste, though.</i>

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:16.960
It's commonly accepted that fujoshi delusions are bad, but
don't you think they're much cuter than male fantasies?

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:18.080
Give me an example.

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:23.020
A guy who appears to be an arrogant jerk
turns out to be the slave of a voluptuous, evil woman.

00:23:23.020 --> 00:23:26.770
Another woman with the hairstyle of a court noble
becomes envious and starts to abuse the younger guy,

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:28.800
all while she pretends to be an innocent character.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:30.810
Why does he have to be younger?

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:32.660
I don't intend to argue with a well-endowed person.

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:34.480
Why not have both of them go after the arrogant guy?

00:23:34.480 --> 00:23:35.640
No!

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:37.830
What are you guys talking about?
